cerns: difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric, not willing to further education.\n\nWe need to compare to B: B is conscientious, handles stress, technical, but grumpy/uncooperative.\n\nWe can argue that while B's technical and stress strengths are strong, the crew cooperation concerns are more critical, and A's positive atmosphere suggests better crew cooperation despite communication issues.\n\nThus we can change vote to Candidate A.\n\nWe must include explicit facts and explain implication.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate A."}
