urther education. B maybe okay. D maybe not.\n\nGiven this, A seems strong overall: reliability, decision speed, calm under crisis, positive atmosphere, technical understanding. Communication difficulty is a concern but maybe less severe than B's uncooperative and C's unfriendly. D's interpersonal issues are severe.\n\nThus I think we should shift to Candidate A. Provide reasoning: A's reliability, decision quality, stress resilience, positive crew atmosphere outweigh C's technical strengths but concerns about uncooperativeness and lack of openness. Also note that C's lack of info on stress resilience and crew cooperation is a gap.\n\nThus we will change our vote to Candidate A.\n\nWe need to reference Agent 1 and Agent 3's points, and our own evidence.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate A."}
